   703 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   704 				; Image_Open - OPEN FileNamePtr for read on the first free IOCB (the same
   705 				; sequence LoadData uses, but the file stays open across several block reads).
   706 				;  Out: C=0 and Load_IOCB = IOCB offset, or C=1 (no IOCB / OPEN failed - the
   707 				;       IOCB is closed again so it doesn't leak).
