  1296 380C			Handle_Keys
  1297 				; Dispatch on the current UI mode - the selector, slideshow, drive picker and
  1298 				; info viewer each have their own key set (ui.asm); mode 1 (image view) uses
  1299 				; the set below.
  1300 380C AD FC 02			lda CH
