   880 				;=============================================================================
   881 				; Selector status line (row 20) - the highlighted image's description (typed
   882 				; in the converter, default = source filename without extension; up to
   883 				; NFO_NAME_CAP = 75 chars).  Reading a file per row stuttered a fresh
   884 				; directory, so instead the converter writes all the descriptions once into
   885 				; "IMAGES.LST" (8-byte key + description per record) beside the images.  Nfo_Name_LoadManifest slurps that in one pass on every
   886 				; Rescan_Images into NFO_NAME_VRAM (NFO_NAME_SLOT bytes/ordinal); the draw path
   887 				; is then a pure VRAM read.  No IMAGES.LST -> every slot stays $00 -> the line
   888 				; is simply blank.
   889 				;=============================================================================
   890
